{"entryId":"1987","paragraphs":[{"sourceId":"heilprin:sefaria-warsaw:ta:1987:1","sourceSha256":"06cba1e3b5826db82a750b611a4e04b43d74c9cfe3d06562533ad628d3cbba64","englishSha256":"643d01c44a695316b42f0fc3dea7728800f7714e81b6e7a7a3994803ff7e6f5f","citations":[{"id":"1987:1:link-01","he":[40,66],"en":[52,105],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Zohar%2C_Shmini_6.73"},"reference":"Zohar, Shmini 6:73","assessment":"The sages ask the boy his name and his father’s name, and he identifies his father as Rabbi Zeaira of Kefar Ramin.","evidence":[{"reference":"Zohar, Shmini 6:73","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Zohar%2C_Shmini_6.73"},"witness":"Vocalized Zohar, Israel 2013"},{"reference":"Zohar, Shmini 6:74","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Zohar%2C_Shmini_6.74"},"witness":"Vocalized Zohar, Israel 2013"},{"reference":"Zohar, Shmini 6:75","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Zohar%2C_Shmini_6.75"},"witness":"Vocalized Zohar, Israel 2013"}]},{"id":"1987:1:link-02","he":[96,139],"en":[159,225],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Zohar%2C_Shmini_13.97"},"reference":"Zohar, Shmini 13:97","assessment":"The checked Zohar assigns the nickname to the companions collectively. Use a passive construction for Heilprin’s compressed wording.","evidence":[{"reference":"Zohar, Shmini 13:97","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Zohar%2C_Shmini_13.97"},"witness":"Vocalized Zohar, Israel 2013"}]}],"inlineHebrew":[0,1],"holds":[{"raw":"זוהר שמיני עש\"ח ועע\"א","reason":"The two story loci have been identified. The raw printed folio forms remain visible pending collation of Heilprin’s edition.","evidence":[{"reference":"Zohar, Shmini 6:74","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Zohar%2C_Shmini_6.74"},"witness":"Vocalized Zohar, Israel 2013"},{"reference":"Zohar, Shmini 6:75","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Zohar%2C_Shmini_6.75"},"witness":"Vocalized Zohar, Israel 2013"},{"reference":"Zohar, Shmini 13:96","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Zohar%2C_Shmini_13.96"},"witness":"Vocalized Zohar, Israel 2013"},{"reference":"Zohar, Shmini 13:97","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Zohar%2C_Shmini_13.97"},"witness":"Vocalized Zohar, Israel 2013"}]}],"notes":[{"text":"The sages ask the boy his name and his father’s name, and he identifies his father as Rabbi Zeaira of Kefar Ramin.","references":[],"urls":[]},{"text":"Yehudah explicitly says he learned from the boy’s father three teachings about the cup of blessing and two about Creation. The excerpt’s numeral refers to the first set.","references":[],"urls":[]},{"text":"The checked Zohar assigns the nickname to the companions collectively. Use a passive construction for Heilprin’s compressed wording.","references":[],"urls":[]},{"text":"The two story loci have been identified. The raw printed folio forms remain visible pending collation of Heilprin’s edition.","references":[],"urls":[]}],"comparisonEvidence":[{"reference":"Zohar, Shmini 6:73","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Zohar%2C_Shmini_6.73"},"witness":"Vocalized Zohar, Israel 2013"},{"reference":"Zohar, Shmini 6:74","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Zohar%2C_Shmini_6.74"},"witness":"Vocalized Zohar, Israel 2013"},{"reference":"Zohar, Shmini 6:75","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Zohar%2C_Shmini_6.75"},"witness":"Vocalized Zohar, Israel 2013"},{"reference":"Zohar, Shmini 13:97","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Zohar%2C_Shmini_13.97"},"witness":"Vocalized Zohar, Israel 2013"}]}],"entryEvidence":[]}
